      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 3.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.0,
      "end_seconds": 9.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.08,
      "end_seconds": 20.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "mainly I've been wanting contraception. That's why I came. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.08,
      "end_seconds": 25.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "okay, has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.1,
      "end_seconds": 33.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "About... well, five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.48,
      "end_seconds": 37.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I follow. Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.68,
      "end_seconds": 44.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, uh, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.92,
      "end_seconds": 51.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.59,
      "end_seconds": 66.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "okay, sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.55,
      "end_seconds": 87.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.29,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, respiratory rate 14, pulse is 85 beats a minute. And temperature is 36.5 degrees, blood pressure 121 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.61,
      "end_seconds": 92.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.83,
      "end_seconds": 93.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.78,
      "end_seconds": 97.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.99,
      "end_seconds": 117.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.03,
      "end_seconds": 121.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.55,
      "end_seconds": 129.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "all finished, thank you have you had any migraine with aura, breast lumps or smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.76,
      "end_seconds": 137.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "no migraine with aura, breast lumps or smoking, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.38,
      "end_seconds": 140.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.3,
      "end_seconds": 143.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.67,
      "end_seconds": 149.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.45,
      "end_seconds": 153.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, so no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.36,
      "end_seconds": 171.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.57,
      "end_seconds": 174.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.02,
      "end_seconds": 177.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.38,
      "end_seconds": 182.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Just a varicose vein procedure, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.67,
      "end_seconds": 198.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.37,
      "end_seconds": 208.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.62,
      "end_seconds": 210.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.93,
      "end_seconds": 217.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.91,
      "end_seconds": 222.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.32,
      "end_seconds": 226.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.12,
      "end_seconds": 231.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.54,
      "end_seconds": 244.5,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "Let me think, I have acid reflux, for about a year. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.55,
      "end_seconds": 251.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.31,
      "end_seconds": 263.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.52,
      "end_seconds": 267.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.18,
      "end_seconds": 308.58,
      "duration_seconds": 29.4,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. We'll begin with levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. It's for contraception. Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two. Book a review in three months. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.43,
      "end_seconds": 312.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.51,
      "end_seconds": 314.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}